  <h1>The week in AI assurance and governance.</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    A weekly digest for risk and compliance professionals, AI practitioners, and executives and boards,
    drawn from Australian government, regulators, standards bodies, frontier AI labs and quality news.
  </p>

  <h2>What each Friday edition will include</h2>
  <ul class="plain">
    <li><strong>Top Signals</strong>: the 3–5 developments that matter most this week.</li>
    <li>Themed sections: policy &amp; legislation, regulator guidance, public sector AI, standards &amp; frameworks, frontier labs, international, and news.</li>
    <li>For every item, a neutral summary, a "why it matters" line, a source authority badge, and verbatim quotes from the source so you can check the summary.</li>
    <li>An open consultations tracker, a key dates &amp; obligations timeline, and a searchable archive.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="muted">The first edition is in preparation.</p>
</Base>
